      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The key feature is quantifier order: first choose the tolerance, then choose a fixed truncation scale, and only afterward move far enough in the asymptotic variable. This converts uniform pair-energy decay into an asymptotic prime-side improvement without demanding one estimate work optimally at every scale.",
