      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "Expansion changes an opaque norm into explicit pair interactions; symmetrization then aligns those interactions with the cumulative statistic already available. Retaining the transform rather than merely majorizing it prepares a later main-term comparison capable of supporting positivity.",
